# AttendNova - Complete Product Requirements Document

## Executive Summary

AttendNova is a comprehensive attendance tracking and management system designed for organizations to streamline employee attendance, leave management, and workforce analytics. The system provides role-based access for Employees, Managers, and Admins with distinct features tailored to each role's responsibilities.

