## 1. Project Overview

### Vision
Create an intuitive, modern, and feature-rich attendance management system that eliminates manual attendance tracking and provides real-time insights into workforce presence.

### Goals
- Automate attendance tracking with location verification
- Streamline leave request and approval workflows
- Provide comprehensive analytics for managers and admins
- Ensure mobile-first responsive design
- Deliver exceptional user experience with modern UI/UX

### Technology Stack
- **Frontend**: Flutter/Dart (Mobile & Web)
- **Backend**: Flask/Python REST API
- **Database**: PostgreSQL/MySQL
- **Authentication**: JWT tokens
- **Location Services**: GPS/Geolocation API

---

## 2. User Roles & Personas

### 2.1 Employee
**Primary User**: Regular employees who need to track their attendance and manage leaves.

**Needs**:
- Quick and easy check-in/check-out
- View attendance history
- Request and track leaves
- Access profile and settings

### 2.2 Manager
**Primary User**: Team leads and department managers overseeing employee attendance.

**Needs**:
- Monitor team attendance in real-time
- Approve/reject leave requests
- Generate team reports
- View individual employee performance

### 2.3 Admin
**Primary User**: HR personnel and system administrators with full access.

**Needs**:
- Manage all users and departments
- Configure system settings
- Access company-wide analytics
- Create and assign roles

