## 5. User Experience Design

### 5.1 Design Principles
- **Mobile-First & Fully Responsive**: Optimize for mobile devices first, then scale seamlessly to tablets and desktop
- **Royal Plum Theme**: Elegant light theme with sophisticated color palette
- **Minimalist**: Clean, uncluttered interfaces with purposeful whitespace
- **Responsive Breakpoints**: 
  - Mobile: 320px - 767px (single column layouts, bottom navigation)
  - Tablet: 768px - 1023px (2-column grids where appropriate)
  - Desktop: 1024px+ (multi-column layouts, sidebar navigation)
- **Accessible**: WCAG 2.1 AA compliance with proper contrast ratios

### 5.2 Royal Plum Design Specifications

#### 5.2.1 Primary Color Palette
```
Primary Colors:
├─ Deep Plum: #310A31 (Primary brand color, buttons, headers)
├─ Cream Background: #F4ECD6 (Main background color)
└─ Card White: #FFFFFF (Card backgrounds, elevated surfaces)

Text Colors:
├─ Dark Heading: #310A31 (Primary headings on light backgrounds)
├─ Light Heading: #F4ECD6 (Headings on dark backgrounds)
├─ Body Text: #5D4B5D (Regular content text)
└─ Muted Text: #9E8D9E (Secondary text, labels, placeholders)

Status Colors:
├─ Green: #2E7D32 (Present, Approved, Success states)
├─ Amber: #F57F17 (Pending, Warning states)
├─ Crimson: #C62828 (Absent, Rejected, Error states)
└─ Blue: #1565C0 (In Progress, Informational states)

Shadows:
└─ Card Shadow: rgba(49, 10, 49, 0.05) with 20px blur, 4px offset
```

#### 5.2.2 Typography System
```
Headings:
├─ H1: 32px, Bold, Color: #310A31
├─ H2: 24px, Bold, Color: #310A31
├─ H3: 20px, Semi-Bold (600), Color: #310A31
└─ H4: 18px, Semi-Bold (600), Color: #310A31

Body Text:
├─ Large: 16px, Normal, Color: #5D4B5D
├─ Medium: 14px, Normal, Color: #5D4B5D
└─ Small: 12px, Normal, Color: #9E8D9E

Font Family: System default sans-serif (Roboto on Android, SF Pro on iOS)
Line Height: 1.5x for body text, 1.3x for headings
```

#### 5.2.3 Spacing & Layout
```
Padding/Margin Scale:
├─ xs: 4px
├─ sm: 8px
├─ md: 16px
├─ lg: 24px
├─ xl: 32px
└─ 2xl: 48px

Border Radius:
├─ Cards: 16px
├─ Buttons: 12px
└─ Input Fields: 12px
```

#### 5.2.4 Responsive Grid System
```
Mobile (320px - 767px):
├─ Single column layouts
├─ Stats cards: 2x2 grid
├─ Bottom navigation bar
├─ Full-width forms
└─ Side padding: 16px

Tablet (768px - 1023px):
├─ 2-column layouts where appropriate
├─ Stats cards: 2x2 or 4-column grid
├─ Side navigation drawer (collapsible)
├─ Form width: 80% max-width
└─ Side padding: 24px

Desktop (1024px+):
├─ Multi-column layouts
├─ Stats cards: 4-column grid
├─ Permanent sidebar navigation
├─ Form width: 600px max-width, centered
├─ Dashboard content: max-width 1400px
└─ Side padding: 32px
```

### 5.3 Animation Standards
- **Spring Physics**: Use spring-based animations for all interactive elements
- **Transition Duration**: 200-300ms for most interactions
- **Easing Curves**: 
  - Entry animations: Ease-out
  - Exit animations: Ease-in
  - Interactive elements: Ease-in-out
- **Micro-animations**:
  - Button press: Scale down to 0.95
  - Card hover (desktop): Scale up to 1.02, add shadow
  - Loading states: Custom Royal Plum themed spinners
  - Success states: Checkmark with expand animation
  - Error states: Shake animation with crimson highlight

### 5.4 Responsive Navigation

#### Employee Navigation
- **Mobile (320px - 767px)**: Fixed bottom navigation bar with 4 tabs
  - Home (dashboard icon)
  - Leaves (calendar icon)
  - Profile (person icon)
  - Settings (gear icon)
- **Tablet (768px - 1023px)**: Bottom navigation bar or optional side drawer
- **Desktop (1024px+)**: Left sidebar navigation with icons and labels

#### Manager Navigation
- **Mobile (320px - 767px)**: Hamburger menu with slide-in drawer
  - Dashboard
  - Team
  - Reports
  - Settings
- **Tablet (768px - 1023px)**: Collapsible sidebar (icon-only when collapsed)
- **Desktop (1024px+)**: Permanent expanded sidebar navigation with full labels

#### Admin Navigation
- **Mobile (320px - 767px)**: Hamburger menu with slide-in drawer
  - Dashboard
  - Users
  - Departments
  - Settings
  - Reports
- **Tablet (768px - 1023px)**: Collapsible sidebar (icon-only when collapsed)
- **Desktop (1024px+)**: Permanent expanded sidebar navigation with full labels

### 5.5 Component Library (Royal Plum Themed)

#### Stat Cards
- **Design**: White cards (#FFFFFF) with subtle shadow on cream background
- **Hover Effect (Desktop)**: Scale to 1.02, enhance shadow
- **Content**: Icon, label, and value with Royal Plum accents
- **Responsive**:
  - Mobile: 2x2 grid, full width in container
  - Tablet: 2x2 or 4-column grid
  - Desktop: 4-column grid with 16px gap

#### Data Tables
- **Design**: White background with Deep Plum headers (#310A31)
- **Features**: Sortable columns, filterable rows, pagination
- **Row Hover**: Light plum tint background
- **Responsive**:
  - Mobile: Card-based view (stacked data)
  - Tablet: Horizontal scroll for wide tables
  - Desktop: Full table display

#### Forms
- **Fields**: White background with plum border, 12px radius
- **Validation**: Real-time with status colors (green/crimson)
- **Focus State**: 2px Deep Plum border
- **Responsive**:
  - Mobile: Full-width inputs, vertical stacking
  - Tablet: 80% width, 2-column for short fields
  - Desktop: 600px max-width, 2-column for short fields

#### Buttons
- **Primary**: Deep Plum background (#310A31), Cream text (#F4ECD6)
- **Secondary**: Cream outline, Plum text
- **Disabled**: 50% opacity
- **Press Animation**: Scale to 0.95
- **Sizes**: Small (32px), Medium (40px), Large (48px)

#### Modals/Dialogs
- **Overlay**: Semi-transparent plum (#310A31 at 30% opacity)
- **Content**: White card with 16px radius
- **Animation**: Slide up from bottom (mobile), fade-scale (desktop)
- **Responsive**:
  - Mobile: Full-width bottom sheet
  - Tablet: 80% width, centered
  - Desktop: 600px width, centered

#### Charts & Visualizations
- **Colors**: Use status colors with plum accents
- **Background**: White cards
- **Interactive**: Tooltips on hover (desktop), tap (mobile)
- **Responsive**: Scale proportionally, adjust legend position

#### Loading States
- **Spinner**: Deep Plum circular progress indicator
- **Skeleton**: Light plum shimmer on white background
- **Progress Bar**: Deep Plum fill on cream track

#### Navigation Components
- **Bottom Nav (Mobile)**: White background, plum active state
- **Sidebar (Desktop)**: Deep Plum background, cream text
- **Active Indicator**: Accent color or background highlight

