## 6. Data Models

### 6.1 User Model
```dart
class User {
  final String id;
  final String email;
  final String fullName;
  final String phone;
  final UserRole role;
  final String? departmentId;
  final String? managerId;
  final String? profilePhotoUrl;
  final bool isActive;
  final DateTime createdAt;
  final DateTime updatedAt;
}

enum UserRole { employee, manager, admin }
```

### 6.2 Attendance Model
```dart
class Attendance {
  final String id;
  final String userId;
  final DateTime checkInTime;
  final Location checkInLocation;
  final DateTime? checkOutTime;
  final Location? checkOutLocation;
  final double? totalHours;
  final AttendanceStatus status;
  final DateTime date;
  final String? notes;
}

enum AttendanceStatus { present, absent, halfDay, onLeave }
```

### 6.3 Leave Model
```dart
class Leave {
  final String id;
  final String userId;
  final LeaveType leaveType;
  final DateTime startDate;
  final DateTime endDate;
  final int totalDays;
  final String reason;
  final LeaveStatus status;
  final String? approvedBy;
  final DateTime? approvalDate;
  final String? managerComments;
  final String? attachmentUrl;
}

enum LeaveType { sick, casual, annual, unpaid }
enum LeaveStatus { pending, approved, rejected }
```

### 6.4 Department Model
```dart
class Department {
  final String id;
  final String name;
  final String? managerId;
  final String description;
  final String location;
  final DateTime createdAt;
  final DateTime updatedAt;
}
```

