## 7. API Specifications

### 7.1 Authentication Endpoints
```
POST /api/auth/login
POST /api/auth/logout
POST /api/auth/refresh-token
POST /api/auth/forgot-password
POST /api/auth/reset-password
```

### 7.2 Employee Endpoints
```
GET    /api/employee/profile
PUT    /api/employee/profile
POST   /api/employee/attendance/check-in
POST   /api/employee/attendance/check-out
GET    /api/employee/attendance/history
POST   /api/employee/leave/request
GET    /api/employee/leave/list
GET    /api/employee/leave/balance
```

### 7.3 Manager Endpoints
```
GET    /api/manager/team/employees
GET    /api/manager/team/attendance
GET    /api/manager/employee/:id
GET    /api/manager/leave/pending
PUT    /api/manager/leave/:id/approve
PUT    /api/manager/leave/:id/reject
GET    /api/manager/reports/attendance
GET    /api/manager/reports/leave
POST   /api/manager/reports/export
```

### 7.4 Admin Endpoints
```
GET    /api/admin/users
POST   /api/admin/users
PUT    /api/admin/users/:id
DELETE /api/admin/users/:id
GET    /api/admin/departments
POST   /api/admin/departments
PUT    /api/admin/departments/:id
DELETE /api/admin/departments/:id
GET    /api/admin/settings
PUT    /api/admin/settings
GET    /api/admin/holidays
POST   /api/admin/holidays
DELETE /api/admin/holidays/:id
GET    /api/admin/reports/company-wide
GET    /api/admin/audit-logs
```

