## Appendix

### A. Glossary
- **Check-in**: Recording the start of work period
- **Check-out**: Recording the end of work period
- **Grace Period**: Allowed lateness without marking late
- **Leave Balance**: Remaining leave days available
- **Working Hours**: Configured standard work duration

